ackage state, and only the task-required MariaDB listener added on node1.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b53a008800304cfd","cmd-e57f667e1db640d9","cmd-945811bd586c4f6d","cmd-1e289aa91caf45f4","cmd-bec766bbe213405c","cmd-50f1fc09418c4bc3","cmd-ae7f322662b84daf","cmd-e3b326a583ec4d60","cmd-ed272acde5d845ed","cmd-02ccc2ce2d5c42c6","cmd-2f7d82f56bc844a4","cmd-31871d3f1da84758","cmd-2e93fd1a8bbf4506","cmd-08f1dd219ae24ed1","cmd-8f3df8fca0e94a1e","cmd-30c105ea1f5d4e0c","cmd-7b3b69795ab84383","cmd-98c27d5b76c241e0","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct final-state and behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol was also completed on both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity independently corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered service, data, credentials, permissions, and system health.","limitations":[]}
